<p>Waqt Nazdeek Tha Aakhri Raat Thi.<br> Zakhmi Zahra Ne Fizza Ko Aawaz Di.<br> Aaein Fizza Tu Zahra Ne Ro Kar Kaha.<br> Ab Tumhare Hawalay Hai Yeh Ghar Mera.<br> Tum Ko Maloom Hai Mera Haal Aye Behan.<br> Mere Bachoon Ka Rakhna Khiyal Aye Behan.</p> 
<p>Yeh Fizza Pukari Bataein Yeh Bibi.<br> Kami Kaisay Maa Ki Main Pori Karon Gi.<br> Woh Dekhtey Hain Tum Ko Tu Milta Hai Unn Ko Chain.<br> Amma Pokartay Hain Tumhein Bhi Hasan Hussain.</p> 
<p>Main Bholi Nahi Aap Ka Ghar Chalana.<br> Woh Ik Waqt Mein Do Farezay Nibhana.<br> Woh Chaki Chalana Woh Jhola Johlana.<br> Kabhi Aap Ke Bin Na Guzra Koi Din.<br> Mujhe Amma Fizza Woh Kehte Hain Lekin.<br> Adat Hai Loriyon Ki Mere Dil Ke Chain Ko.<br> Lori Suna Ke Tum Bhi Sulana Hussain Ko.</p> 
<p>Woh Godi Mein Le Kar Ossay Pyar Karna.<br> Woh Kehna Mere Lal So Ja Hussaina.<br> Woh Aawaz Suntay Hi Betay Ka Sona.<br> Main Jab Oss Ko Lori Sunaon Gi Bibi.<br> Kahan Se Woh Aawaz Laon Gi Bibi.<br> Lagti Bohat Hai Pyas Mere Noor-e-Ain Ko.<br> Uth Uth Ke Shab Mein Pani Pilana Hussain Ko.</p> 
<p>Ho Pyasa Tu Pani Pila Doon Gi Bibi.<br> Main Khana Bhi Oss Ko Khila Doon Gi Bibi.<br> Saweray Main Chehra Dhola Doon Gi Bibi.<br> Galay Se Lagaon Woh Rothay Manaon.<br> Magar Maa Ki Khushbo Kahan Se Main Laon.<br> Zalim Ne Dar Gira Ke Meri Gaud Ujaar Kar.<br> Ik Nasal Khatam Ki Mere Mohsin Ko Mar Kar.</p> 
<p>Aye Bibi Woh Dar Jab Uthaya Tha Main Ne.<br> Shikasta Hai Pehlu Yeh Dekha Tha Main Ne.<br> Woh Jab Aap Se Haal Pocha Tha Main Ne.<br> Na Gham Pasliyon Ka Na Pehlu Ka Sadma.<br> Thi Yeh Fikar Mohsin Na Mar Jaye Mera.<br> Jab Bhi Hasan Ke Samne Jati Hai Fatima.<br> Hathoon Se Apne Gaal Chupati Hai Fatima.</p> 
<p>Kaha Ro Ke Fizza Ne Aye Shah Zadi.<br> Woh Chup Chup Ke Rota Hai Ghurbat Pe Maa Ki.<br> Nishaan Ungliyon Ke Hain Chehray Pe Ab Bhi.<br> Janazay Pe Aa Ke Woh Chehra Jo Dekhey.<br> Main Oss Waqt Oss Ko Sanbhalon Gi Kaisay.<br> Be Pardah Layi Jaein Gi Bazar Betiyaan.<br> Meri Tarha Se Jaein Gi Darbar Betiyaan.</p> 
<p>Unhein Shamiyon Se Bacha Loon Gi Bibi.<br> Main Hathoon Ko Chadar Bana Loon Gi Bibi.<br> Unhein Apne Pichey Chupa Loon Gi Bibi.<br> Khulay Sar Woh Haye Jo Darbar Jaye.<br> Chali Aaiye Ga Jo Zainab Bulaye.<br> Tasbeeh Kar Rahi Thi Jo Aawaz Kho Gayi.<br> Thak Kar Ghamo Se Fatima Khamosh Ho Gayi.</p> 
<p>Janazay Pe Zahra Ke Dekha Yeh Manzar.<br> Kaha Jab Yeh Shabeer Ne Maa Se Ro Kar.<br> Aye Amma Bola Lo Hai Be Chain Dilbar.<br> Yeh Sun Kar Kafan Se Uthay Hath Maa Ke.<br> Yeh Fizza Ne Dekha Tu Bolein Ali Se.</p> 
<p>RAZA aur ZEESHAN Kaisa Sama Tha.<br> Woh Jab Shimar Ne Sheh Pe Khanjar Chalaya.<br> Pohanch Kar Yeh Maqtal Mein Fizza Ne Dekha.<br> Pisar Ke Sirhaney Kaha Fatima Ne.<br> Lehad Chor Aayi Hoon Tujh Ko Bachaney.</p>